TASK-211 runtime harness: the Settings list panes with their list and detail
column fixed and scrolling on their own, Links' route list scrolling above a
fixed Default, the new Quick Detour pane, and Extensions' Uninstall button
fixed below the details. Temporary code, never committed to Detour/. Gated on
DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR; DETOUR_VERIFY_APPEARANCE light or dark; DETOUR_VERIFY_EXTS
a folder of unpacked MV3 extensions (14 copies named "Verify Ext eNN", each
with 12 API permissions and 3 hosts, so the detail column overflows). Data
dir DetourVerify2110; seeds 18 spaces, 15 profiles, 12 routes once. Waits
for 12 s of HID idle before showing Settings (which activates the app).
Scroll-wheel events are phase-less pixel CGEvents turned into NSEvents and
handed to the view hit at the column's middle (phased events left a column
overscrolled). run.sh is TASK-213's with the data dir and the extensions
folder changed (SHOOT lines served with screencapture -l, only the launched
PID killed).

    git apply docs/harness/task211-harness.patch && xcodegen generate
    xcodebuild -scheme Detour -configuration Debug build -derivedDataPath .derived
    run.sh light; run.sh dark
    git apply -R docs/harness/task211-harness.patch && xcodegen generate

Results (2026-10-27, light and dark logs identical apart from idle waits;
28 captures; no "Unable to simultaneously satisfy"):
- Toolbar: General, Spaces, Links, Quick Detour, Profiles, Extensions,
