- At the 400 pt minimum: Spaces list 220x304 (offset max 200), details
  460x333; Profiles list 220x289 (max 131), details 460x318 (content 965);
  Extensions list 220x331 (max 61), details 460x316 (content 601) above
  Uninstall (260,20 139x24, 20 pt gap). A wheel over the details scrolled
  them (Profiles 0->400, Extensions 0->285 = end) with the list frame and
  offset unchanged; a wheel over the list scrolled it to its end with the
  details unchanged. Uninstall stayed at the same frame and visible with
